## Build the environment — route strategy

Rebuild a faithful, bootable target using the strategy for this route.

There is NO build material and NO exploit (`AW`): only a writeup. The writeup is
the SOLE runtime anchor, and no exploit exists to corroborate any inference, so
confidence is low by construction. Infer the runtime from the writeup alone,
author a Dockerfile that realizes it, and mark it explicitly unverified.

