## Prove it exploitable — route strategy

With the target frozen, prove it faithfully exploitable: run the exploit
under `solve/` from the player vantage against a fresh clean instance until
it captures the harness-minted flag.

Material profile `{{ instance_data.route.material_profile }}`: only the writeup
(`W`). No runnable exploit, and the environment itself was *inferred from this
same writeup*, not from build material. Neither side is anchored by an
independent source, so a failing pair is genuinely ambiguous — the exploit may
be wrong, or the inferred runtime may be unfaithful.

